---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="border-t border-border-subtle bg-bg-canvas mt-20">
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-8 py-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-6 text-[13px] leading-normal font-mono text-text-secondary">
    <div class="space-y-1">
      <p class="text-text-primary font-sans font-medium text-sm">
        Juan Silva Garcia — Ciência da Computação (IF Sudeste MG)
      </p>
      <p>Site estático construído com Astro 7, TypeScript e Tailwind CSS v4.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-4">
      <a href="/design-system/" class="min-h-[44px] inline-flex items-center text-accent-text hover:underline">
        Design System
      </a>
      <span aria-hidden="true">•</span>
      <span>© {currentYear}</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
